Bundle-Name: Eclipse Fennec Mapping
Bundle-Description: Plain-Java engine of the generic Fennec mapping: produces slot values from source \
	objects (OCL expression, function, feature path, constant, converter), resolves source to target \
	identities with a cache, validates mappings and keeps them in a registry. No OSGi needed.

-workingset: mapping

-library: enableEMF

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.service.condition;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.atlas.configuration.model;version=latest,\
	org.eclipse.fennec.mapping.model;version=latest

-testpath: \
	assertj-core
